- **Related visual research:** [Sottsass’s *Casablanca* and *Carlton* drawings, 1981, at the V&A](https://www.vam.ac.uk/info/collection-selection-boxes-postmodern-design).
- **Related visual research:** [April Greiman’s work, including *Does It Make Sense?*, in *Eye on Design*](https://eyeondesign.aiga.org/april-greiman-is-still-ahead-of-the-curve/).

